#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""GTK popup for timur-bar on i3/X11, the same panel the Omarchy bar opens.

  timur-panel              open (or close, if already open) on the Time entry tab
  timur-panel journal      open on the Journal note tab
  timur-panel --yesterday  start on yesterday

One instance: running it again toggles the open window. It reads
~/.cache/timur-bar/state.json and runs `timur-bar` for every change, like
Panel.qml. Needs python-gobject and gtk3.

  TIMUR_PANEL_OFFSET  pixels between the top of the monitor and the panel (bar height, default 30)
"""

